msgid ""
"The ``subtract`` method decrements counts in place and, unlike the ``-`` "
"operator, keeps zero and negative results. ``b`` becomes ``1 - 2 = -1``."
msgstr ""
"El método ``subtract`` decrementa los recuentos in situ y, a diferencia del "
"operador ``-``, conserva los resultados cero y negativos. ``b`` pasa a ser "
"``1 - 2 = -1``."

