#: ../../../library-medium.rst:529
msgid ""
"``sort_keys=True`` orders keys alphabetically in the output regardless of "
"insertion order, but the values stay attached to their own keys: ``a`` keeps"
" ``2`` and ``b`` keeps ``1``."
msgstr ""
"``sort_keys=True`` ordena las claves alfabéticamente en la salida sin "
"importar el orden de inserción, pero los valores permanecen ligados a sus "
"propias claves: ``a`` mantiene ``2`` y ``b`` mantiene ``1``."

#: ../../../library-medium.rst:555
msgid "``BLUE``"
msgstr "``BLUE``"

#: ../../../library-medium.rst:560
msgid ""
"``auto()`` assigns increasing integers starting at ``1`` by default, so "
"``RED=1``, ``GREEN=2``, ``BLUE=3``. ``Color.BLUE.value`` is ``3``."
msgstr ""
"``auto()`` asigna enteros crecientes empezando en ``1`` por defecto, así que"
" ``RED=1``, ``GREEN=2``, ``BLUE=3``. ``Color.BLUE.value`` es ``3``."
